{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26697","headline":"寄李余卧疾 · 姚合","name":"寄李余卧疾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷节弥惨栗，我讵自云乐。\n伊人婴疾恙，所对唯苦药。\n寂寞行稍稀，清羸飡自薄。\n幽斋外浮事，梦寐亦简略。\n雪户掩复明，风帘卷还落。\n方持数桮酒，勉子同斟酌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}